WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.400
- So you have a tradition
at the show, right?

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.540
- We do.
- I love this tradition.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:06.120
- Yeah, so we share a
dressing room at our theater,

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.980
and every week we award someone

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.690
something called the Shuckey,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.240
which is this like little statue

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.500
John crafted with his children, right?

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.333
- Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:16.890
- And we give it every week.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.180
It's like employee of the week,

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.050
and so we give it every week

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:21.270
to someone that has gone
like above and beyond

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.200
in the building.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.420
And we would like to do our weekly award

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.790
here on air if we could.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:29.193
- Do we have the Shuckey?
(audience applauding)

00:00:29.193 --> 00:00:30.840
- Oh, yeah. So here it is.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.670
- Oh my god, it's corn.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:33.735
- John made this at home.
- I love it,

00:00:33.735 --> 00:00:35.073
"Oh my God, it's corn."

00:00:35.073 --> 00:00:36.780
- With the hand-painted

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.910
and mounted from some old
thing I had in my house.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:40.290
- And he's prepared a speech.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:43.230
- Kelly, we are so thankful

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:46.050
that you chose to break
away from Los Angeles.

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:47.880
The West coast has been
a little less bright

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.260
since you've been gone.
- Oh, thank you.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:51.655
- But New York is stronger with you in it.

00:00:51.655 --> 00:00:52.488
- I see what you're doing.

00:00:52.488 --> 00:00:53.910
- The chemistry is real.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:55.860
All I ever wanted was for Shuck

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.680
to be the first Broadway
show to perform on your show

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:00.780
in a moment like this.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:02.340
I don't know the meaning of life.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:03.173
- Oh my God.

00:01:03.173 --> 00:01:04.620
- But gratitude has got to be part of it.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.170
So we made the Shuckey piece by piece,

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:09.510
and now we present it to you.

00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:10.343
- Thank you.

00:01:10.343 --> 00:01:11.640
- So now Shuckey in hand,

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:14.610
when Christmas comes around
and you're underneath the tree,

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:17.130
you can tell yourself,
this is my December.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:18.240
- This is my. It's mine!

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.229
- Kelly.

00:01:19.229 --> 00:01:20.646
(audience applauding)

00:01:20.646 --> 00:01:23.430
- That was good. (indistinct)

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:24.516
Thank you so much.

00:01:24.516 --> 00:01:25.986
- My life would shuck without you.

00:01:25.986 --> 00:01:28.986
(audience cheering)

00:01:30.019 --> 00:01:31.612
- Sure.

00:01:31.612 --> 00:01:34.440
- He said, "My life
would shuck without you."

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:37.492
- And I would like to thank Texas and....

00:01:37.492 --> 00:01:38.325
- And who else?
- Who else?

00:01:38.325 --> 00:01:39.870
- For all of us. For
just raising all of us.

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:41.850
- What's funny, is I really assumed

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:43.152
I was the one gettin' the trophy.

00:01:43.152 --> 00:01:45.283
(everyone laughing)

00:01:45.283 --> 00:01:46.380
I even moved up.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:47.377
- You're like ready for your moment.

00:01:47.377 --> 00:01:48.783
- I got the emotional face.

00:01:48.783 --> 00:01:51.660
- Yes, yes. Not your time.

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:52.891
- I've done so (indistinct)
- It's my time.

00:01:52.891 --> 00:01:53.724
- It's your time.
- Yeah.

00:01:53.724 --> 00:01:55.373
- It's my time. Like Goonies.
- Yeah.

